2. Definitions

“Project Owner” means GlitchMars.

“Project” means Heketsu Boy, including its official source code, assets, documentation, data, and other materials made available by the Project Owner.

“Official Repository” means the repository or repositories designated by the Project Owner as the official source of the Project.

“Project Materials” means code, assets, artwork, models, textures, audio, music, documentation, data, designs, and other materials owned by the Project Owner and distributed as part of the Project.

“Mod” means a modification, extension, addition, replacement, or other derivative work created for or in connection with the Project.

“Modified Material” means original work created by a Mod creator that modifies, extends, or adds to Project Materials.

“Contributor” means a person or entity that submits material for inclusion in the Official Repository.

“Contribution” means code, assets, artwork, documentation, data, or other material intentionally submitted by a Contributor for inclusion in the Official Repository.

