Mods may be distributed publicly, including for commercial purposes, provided that the distribution complies with this License and applicable law.

A Mod creator must not represent their Mod as an official release of the Project unless expressly authorized by the Project Owner.

A Mod creator must not falsely claim ownership of Project Materials.

A Mod creator may identify their Mod as a modification for Heketsu Boy for purposes of compatibility and description.

